A345253	filfix	0	new A059893()	(Palindromes and coincidence of elements): Trees a(n) and €232560 coincide when the sequence of left and right branching is a palindrome: a(€329395(n)) = €232560(€329395(n)). As Kimberling notes (cf. D059893), this happens at fixed points of D059893(n) or, equivalently, at n for which J081242(n) is a palindrome.
